        {"zh": "岩层中跃出！", "en": "Jumps from rocks!"},
        {"zh": "风暴中降生！", "en": "Born in storms!"},
        {"zh": "我从三叠纪的蕨丛里走出来。", "en": "I step out of the Triassic ferns."},
        {"zh": "闪电中降临！", "en": "Descends in lightning!"},
